      "description": "<ul><li><p>Target creature gains <strong>Crystal High</strong>: each of its <strong>Attributes</strong> increases by two die sizes for 3 turns.</p></li><li><p>When <strong>Crystal High</strong> ends or is removed during a battle, the creature gains <strong>Crystal Withdraw</strong>: each of its <strong>Attributes</strong> decreases by two die sizes for 3 turns.</p></li><li><p>If the target has already consumed a <strong>Crystal Powder</strong> in this scene, it gains <strong>Crystal Withdraw</strong> instead (ending any <strong>Crystal High</strong>).</p></li></ul>",
